SUMMARY:The Upper Room Men's Group
DESCRIPTION:The Upper Room Men’s Group Breakfast\nJoin the Upper Room Men’s Group in the parish house forum room for breakfast. \nMen of all ages are welcome to this time of food\, fellowship and prayer. Email Paul Peachey or Chuck Smith to let them know you’ll be attending.
